{"name":"Defenestration","hex":"#c6d5e4","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"defenestration","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The act of throwing something or especially someone out of a window, especially lethally. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The high-profile removal of a person from an organization.\n\n to eliminate from a contest or sport championship"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/defenestration"}],"entries":[{"title":"Defenestration","blocks":[{"text":"Defenestration is the act of throwing someone or something out of a window.\nThe term was coined around the time of an incident in Prague Castle in the year 1618 which became the spark that started the Thirty Years' War. This was done in \"good Bohemian style\", referring to the defenestration which had occurred in Prague's New Town Hall almost 200 years earlier, and on that occasion led to the Hussite war. The word comes from the Neo-Latin de- and fenestra."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Prager.Fenstersturz.1618.jpg/330px-Prager.Fenstersturz.1618.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Defenestration"},{"title":"Defenestration (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Defenestration are a UK nu metal band, based in Northamptonshire. The band were originally active between 1999 - 2004 and reunited in 2024."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Defenestration_(band)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/097.The_Death_of_Jezebel.jpg/500px-097.The_Death_of_Jezebel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/097.The_Death_of_Jezebel.jpg/1280px-097.The_Death_of_Jezebel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/097.The_Death_of_Jezebel.jpg/500px-097.The_Death_of_Jezebel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The defenestration of the Biblical Queen Jezebel at Jezreel, by Gustave Doré","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A097.The_Death_of_Jezebel.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/O_povo_amotinado_precipita_o_cad%C3%A1ver_do_bispo_D._Martinho_da_torre_da_S%C3%A9_%28Roque_Gameiro%2C_in_Leonor_Telles%2C_por_Marcelino_Mesquita%2C_1904%29.png/500px-O_povo_amotinado_precipita_o_cad%C3%A1ver_do_bispo_D._Martinho_da_torre_da_S%C3%A9_%28Roque_Gameiro%2C_in_Leonor_Telles%2C_por_Marcelino_Mesquita%2C_1904%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/O_povo_amotinado_precipita_o_cad%C3%A1ver_do_bispo_D._Martinho_da_torre_da_S%C3%A9_%28Roque_Gameiro%2C_in_Leonor_Telles%2C_por_Marcelino_Mesquita%2C_1904%29.png/1280px-O_povo_amotinado_precipita_o_cad%C3%A1ver_do_bispo_D._Martinho_da_torre_da_S%C3%A9_%28Roque_Gameiro%2C_in_Leonor_Telles%2C_por_Marcelino_Mesquita%2C_1904%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/O_povo_amotinado_precipita_o_cad%C3%A1ver_do_bispo_D._Martinho_da_torre_da_S%C3%A9_%28Roque_Gameiro%2C_in_Leonor_Telles%2C_por_Marcelino_Mesquita%2C_1904%29.png/500px-O_povo_amotinado_precipita_o_cad%C3%A1ver_do_bispo_D._Martinho_da_torre_da_S%C3%A9_%28Roque_Gameiro%2C_in_Leonor_Telles%2C_por_Marcelino_Mesquita%2C_1904%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Bishop of Lisbon D. Martinho de Zamora is thrown by the revolted populace from the cathedral's bell tower, as depicted by Roque Gameiro, in 1904.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AO_povo_amotinado_precipita_o_cad%C3%A1ver_do_bispo_D._Martinho_da_torre_da_S%C3%A9_(Roque_Gameiro%2C_in_Leonor_Telles%2C_por_Marcelino_Mesquita%2C_1904).png"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/Giorgio_Vasari_San_Bartolomeo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/Giorgio_Vasari_San_Bartolomeo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Giorgio Vasari's impression of the St. Bartholomew's Day massacre","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGiorgio_Vasari_San_Bartolomeo.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/D%C3%A9fenestration.jpg/500px-D%C3%A9fenestration.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/D%C3%A9fenestration.jpg/1280px-D%C3%A9fenestration.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/D%C3%A9fenestration.jpg/500px-D%C3%A9fenestration.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A stuntman diving out a window","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AD%C3%A9fenestration.jpg"}],"sounds":{"defenestration":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7e/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-defenestration.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7e/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-defenestration.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-defenestration.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7e/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-defenestration.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28Naom